格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"AtomGit plugin bundle for DeepSeek Harness (dsh): atomgit-skills workflows + ag CLI + platform-hosted AtomGit/GitCode MCP tools","id":"gh:1334399945","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-atomgit","slug":"xiongjiamu/dsh-atomgit","topics":["atomgit","atomgit-cli","dsh-plugin","dsh-plugins","gitcode","gitcode-cli","gitcode-mpc"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"AtomGit plugin bundle for DeepSeek Harness (dsh): atomgit-skills workflows + ag CLI + platform-hoste"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"d AtomGit/GitCode MCP tools"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-atomgit"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"English | 中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"AtomGit plugin bundle for DeepSeek Harness (dsh): lets dsh users host and manage code on AtomGit out"},{"id":"p4s2","text":" of the box. One package delivers all three AtomGit services:"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"| Layer | Source | Shape in dsh |"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"| Workflow | atomgit-skills | Six built-in skills in the model's `<available_skills>` catalog, loade"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"d on demand via the `skill` tool |\n| Execution | atomgit-cli (`ag`) | The model runs `ag` commands d"},{"id":"p6s3","text":"irectly through the built-in bash tool |\n| Interaction | AtomGit platform-hosted MCP server (`https:"},{"id":"p6s4","text":"//api.atomgit.com/mcp-server/v1/mcp`) | Native tools `mcp__atomgit__*` bridged by `@deepseek-ai/dsh-"},{"id":"p6s5","text":"mcp-client` over streamable-http; no local server to run |"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"Built-in skills (vendored from the atomgit-skills upstream): `atomgit-plan-issues`, `atomgit-impleme"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"nt-issue`, `atomgit-review-pr`, `atomgit-merge-pr`, `atomgit-publish-cli-release`, `atomgit-mirror-t"},{"id":"p7s3","text":" `atomgit-review-pr`, `atomgit-merge-pr`, `atomgit-publish-cli-release`, `atomgit-mirror-to-github`."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## Installation"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"Prerequisites — **one authentication step covers all three modules**:"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"That's it. No separate token setup for the MCP endpoint or the skills."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"## Authentication (unified)"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"All three modules share **one AtomGit PAT** — the same credential `ag auth login` obtains (its OAuth"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"hare **one AtomGit PAT** — the same credential `ag auth login` obtains (its OAuth token *is* a PAT):"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"| Module | How it authenticates |"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"| `ag` CLI / skills | Read `~/.config/ag-cli/token.json` directly |\n| MCP endpoint (`mcp__atomgit__*"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"`) | The plugin's `atomgitAuth` service resolves the token from the same ag credential file and send"},{"id":"p15s3","text":"s it as `Authorization: Bearer <PAT>`; no user setup |"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"Optional override: to use a different token (e.g. a manually created PAT from AtomGit → Settings → A"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"ccess tokens), set `ATOMGIT_TOKEN` in the `.env` of the dsh working directory — the plugin falls bac"},{"id":"p16s3","text":"k to it when the ag credential file is absent."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"Install the bundle (run from the directory containing this package):"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"## What the model gets"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"After startup the model side automatically gains:"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"- Six `atomgit-*` skills in the `<available_skills>` catalog, loaded on demand via the `skill` tool;"},{"id":"p21s2","text":" `references/` files (e.g. `ag-commands.md`) are read on demand through the directory resource hint."},{"id":"p21s3","text":"\n- Native `mcp__atomgit__*` tools (repos / branches / issues / PRs / search) from the AtomGit platfo"},{"id":"p21s4","text":"rm-hosted MCP server — no local server, Docker, or Python install needed.\n- `ag` in bash (`ag repo v"},{"id":"p21s5","text":"iew`, `ag pr list`, `ag issue create`, …)."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"Typical workflow: `atomgit-plan-issues` to plan issues → `atomgit-implement-issue` to implement and "},{"id":"p22s2","text":"open a PR → `atomgit-review-pr` to review → `atomgit-merge-pr` to merge after your explicit authoriz"},{"id":"p22s3","text":" PR → `atomgit-review-pr` to review → `atomgit-merge-pr` to merge after your explicit authorization."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"## Configuration overrides"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"A patch replaces a row's whole `config`; users override by row id in their profile `cordis.patch.yml"},{"id":"p24s2","text":"` or a `--patch` overlay:"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"## Syncing skills"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"`skills/` is vendored from the atomgit-skills upstream pinned to a tag, keeping \"plugin version ↔ sk"},{"id":"p27s2","text":"ill version\" reproducible:"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"- Plugin code and packaging of this bundle: MulanPSL-2.0.\n- Built-in skills come from atomgit-skills"},{"id":"p30s2","text":"; their license (MulanPSL-2.0) is copied with the skills at `skills/LICENSE`."}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
